## 1. Why Danger.js in Enterprise Mobile CI/CD

During manual code reviews, senior developers frequently waste valuable engineering time repeating basic hygiene requests:
* *"Please provide a summary of what changed and how to test it."*
* *"Please assign yourself to this Pull Request."*
* *"This PR is marked WIP, why is it opened for review?"*
* *"This PR modifies 1,400 lines across 60 files; please split it into smaller PRs."*

Danger.js eliminates this friction by running as an automated, impartial code reviewer on Bitrise. It inspects Pull Request metadata and Git diffs, executing programmed rules codified in a <code>dangerfile.ts</code>, and posts a structured comment directly onto the GitHub PR.

---

