      <tr>
        <td><code>Rate limit exceeded on GitHub API</code></td>
        <td>Unauthenticated API calls or shared token across multiple high-volume CI systems.</td>
        <td>Confirm <code>$DANGER_GITHUB_API_TOKEN</code> is properly exported in the Bitrise workflow step environment.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>GitHub Enterprise URL unreachable</code></td>
        <td>Missing <code>DANGER_GITHUB_HOST</code> or <code>DANGER_GITHUB_API_BASE_URL</code> environment variables.</td>
        <td>Verify that the host domain (e.g. <code>git.enterprise.internal</code>) and API URL (<code>https://git.enterprise.internal/api/v3</code>) are declared in <code>app.envs</code>.</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

